</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="395.261" endTime="397.475">
<Sync time="395.261"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Yeh no:
<Who nb="2"/>
Yehwa ya paki:yo:i:loh se: kina:lkalakihtiw.
