<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="534.174" endTime="541.674">
<Sync time="534.174"/>
Ne:n ke:man pe:wa tiki:xchihchi:wa kwali tikwi katí:n yeh eski, *este**, ke:meh eski[k] ..., ¿Ton, [ke:]meh toni tiki:xta:lilia?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="541.674" endTime="577.064">
<Sync time="541.674"/>
Pos neh ke:man nikchihchi:waya n' ilpikat, ekintsi:n a:mo semi n'chi:wa ok, nikchihchi:waya ne: ke:man ya, pero nikwia nochi *hilo** de i:n *cadena**
